      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْمَكْتُهُ</span></b>  <i>I made him to remain, stay, dwell,</i>
or <i>abide,</i> in a place, (S, K,) <i>not quitting</i> it. (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارمك الإِبِلَ</span> <i>He</i> (a pastor) <i>kept the camels
constantly at the water, and fed them with fodder.</i>
(TA.)

